          },
          "790501608": {
            "id": "790501608",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And what's more important is that Paimon can understand it! Perhaps if Paimon imitates the style, she can also paint lovely yet understandable paintings!"
